# Secrets must never be committed to this repository (it is public).
#
# Context: `locks.txt` held the Supabase project URL plus `anon` and
# `service_role` JWTs here from 11 May 2026 to 30 Sep 2026, and
# `app/frontend/.env` held a live Paystack key. Both are ignored by name now, and
# `scripts/secret-scan.py` runs in CI to catch the next one. Use the committed
# `.env.example` files as templates — never a real `.env`.

# Environment files (examples are deliberately allowed through).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!*.env.example

# Credential dumps.
locks.txt
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx

# OS / editor noise.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
